{"title":"Jam","sourceTitle":"Jam/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Jam/de\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Konfitüre (8% translated)\" lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">Deutsch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Jam\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Jam (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Jam/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Confiture (25% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Jam/sk\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Džem (25% translated)\" lang=\"sk\" dir=\"ltr\">slovenčina</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Jam/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Варенье (100% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Jam/uk\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Джем (67% translated)\" lang=\"uk\" dir=\"ltr\">українська</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Jam/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"果酱 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><b>Jam</b> é um alimento consumível. É um tipo de <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/meal\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/meal\">refeição</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Meal\" title=\"Meal\"> </a></span> que pode ser cozinhado num <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/cooking_pot\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/cooking pot\">panela</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cooking_pot\" title=\"Cooking pot\"> </a></span>. Devido ao curto prazo de validade do <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Berry\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Berry\">frutos silvestres</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Berry\" title=\"Berry\"> </a></span>, é importante preservá-los para manter os frutos <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Nutrition\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Nutrition\">nutrição</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Nutrition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nutrition\"> </a></span> por um longo prazo, inclusive durante o <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Winter\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Winter\">inverno</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Winter\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Winter\"> </a></span>, onde os frutos ficarão completamente indisponíveis por meses. Como localizar <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bees\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bees\">abelhas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bees\" title=\"Bees\"> </a></span> para produzir <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Honey\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Honey\">mel</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Honey\" title=\"Honey\"> </a></span> pode ser um desafio desde o início, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Pie\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Pie\">tortas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pie\" title=\"Pie\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Fruitpress\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Fruitpress\">espremendo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Fruitpress\" title=\"Fruitpress\"> </a></span> são geralmente mais fáceis de começar. No entanto, uma vez disponível um suprimento de mel, a geléia dura muito mais tempo, mantendo-se fresca por cerca de 1,5 ano se armazenada em um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cellar\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cellar\">despensa</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cellar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cellar\"> </a></span> bem construído. Além disso, ao contrário do suco e do <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Alcohol\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Alcohol\">álcool</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Alcohol\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Alcohol\"> </a></span>, a geléia aumenta a saciedade de seus ingredientes em vez de reduzi-la.\n</p><p><span id=\"Creation\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Cria.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Criação\">Criação</span></h2>\n<div style=\"float:right;\"><div style=\"left:0px; top:0px; width:261px; height:169px; position:relative;\">\n\t<div style=\"left:0px; top:0px; width:261px; height:169px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"/images/d/d7/Cooking_GUI.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"261\" height=\"169\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"261\" data-file-height=\"169\" /></span></span></div>\n\t<div style=\"left:23px; top:31px; width:46px; height:46px; position:absolute;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Mel\" title=\"Mel\"><img alt=\"Mel\" src=\"/images/thumb/b/b9/Honeyportion.png/46px-Honeyportion.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"46\" height=\"46\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b9/Honeyportion.png/69px-Honeyportion.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/b9/Honeyportion.png/92px-Honeyportion.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div>\n\t<div style=\"left:76px; top:32px; width:46px; height:46px; position:absolute;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Mel\" title=\"Mel\"><img alt=\"Mel\" src=\"/images/thumb/b/b9/Honeyportion.png/46px-Honeyportion.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"46\" height=\"46\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b9/Honeyportion.png/69px-Honeyportion.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/b9/Honeyportion.png/92px-Honeyportion.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div>\n\t<div style=\"left:130px; top:32px; width:46px; height:46px; position:absolute;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Fruta\" title=\"Fruta\"><img alt=\"Fruta\" src=\"/images/thumb/3/3e/All_berries.gif/46px-All_berries.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"46\" height=\"46\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/3/3e/All_berries.gif/69px-All_berries.gif 1.5x, /images/thumb/3/3e/All_berries.gif/92px-All_berries.gif 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div>\n\t<div style=\"left:183px; top:32px; width:46px; height:46px; position:absolute;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Fruta\" title=\"Fruta\"><img alt=\"Fruta\" src=\"/images/thumb/3/3e/All_berries.gif/46px-All_berries.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"46\" height=\"46\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/3/3e/All_berries.gif/69px-All_berries.gif 1.5x, /images/thumb/3/3e/All_berries.gif/92px-All_berries.gif 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div>\n\t<div style=\"left:183px; top:94px; width:46px; height:46px; position:absolute;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Geleia\" title=\"Geleia\"><img alt=\"Geleia\" src=\"/images/thumb/0/0a/Claypot-burned.png/46px-Claypot-burned.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"46\" height=\"46\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/0/0a/Claypot-burned.png/69px-Claypot-burned.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/0/0a/Claypot-burned.png/92px-Claypot-burned.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div> \n        <div style=\"left: 22px; top: 54px; width: 46px; height: 20px; position: absolute; overflow: hidden; text-align: right; vertical-align: text-bottom; margin: 0px 3px 3px -3px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px; color: white; text-shadow: -1px -1px 0 #000, 1px -1px 0 #000, -1px 1px 0 #000, 1px 1px 0 #000;\">0.2L</span></div>\n        <div style=\"left:76px; top:54px; width:46px; height:20px; position:absolute; overflow:hidden; text-align:right; vertical-align:text-bottom; margin: 0px 3px 3px -3px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px; color: white; text-shadow: -1px -1px 0 #000, 1px -1px 0 #000, -1px 1px 0 #000, 1px 1px 0 #000;\">0.2L</span></div>\n<p><br />        \n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><br />\nA geléia deve ser <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cooking\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cooking\">cozido(a)</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\"> </a></span> em uma panela sobre <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/firepit\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/firepit\">fogueira</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Firepit\" title=\"Firepit\"> </a></span>. 6 porções podem ser cozidas de uma vez. Ao contrário de outros tipos de refeição, a geléia possui requisitos rígidos para todos os 4 slots de entrada. 2 slots devem ser de frutas e os outros 2 slots devem ter 0,2 litros de <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Honey\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Honey\">mel</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Honey\" title=\"Honey\"> </a></span> cada. Por exemplo, para 6 porções completas, cada espaço de mel conteria 1,2 litros. Cada favo de mel produzirá 0,2 litros de mel, portanto, uma única porção de geléia exigirá 2 favos de mel. Tanto <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Berry\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Berry\">frutos silvestres</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Berry\" title=\"Berry\"> </a></span> quanto <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Fruit_tree\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Fruit tree\">frutas de árvores</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Fruit_tree\" title=\"Fruit tree\"> </a></span> podem ser usados, e as frutas utilizadas não precisam ser do mesmo tipo.\n</p><p><span id=\"Usage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<p>Após o cozimento, a geléia é armazenada dentro da panela. Os jogadores podem então <abbr title=\"Botão direito do mouse\">uso</abbr> a <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/bowl\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/bowl\">tigela</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bowl\" title=\"Bowl\"> </a></span> (1 porção) ou <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/crock\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/crock\">pote de cerâmica</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Crock\" title=\"Crock\"> </a></span> (até 4 porções) na panela para transferir a geléia para aquele recipiente. As porções também podem ser movidas clicando na panela do inventário com o recipiente desejado. Armazenar a refeição em uma panela de barro proporcionará um ligeiro aumento em sua vida útil. É necessário usar uma tigela para comer a refeição.\n</p><p>A geléia recém-cozida tem vida útil de 45 dias, que pode ser aumentada para cerca de 1,5 ano armazenando-a em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cellar\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cellar\">despensa</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cellar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cellar\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Comida e Culinária</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Encontrar comida</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Wild_food/pt-br\" title=\"Wild food/pt-br\">Forrageamento</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Wild_food/pt-br\" title=\"Wild food/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Farming/pt-br\" title=\"Farming/pt-br\">Agricultura</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming/pt-br\" title=\"Farming/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Animal_husbandry/pt-br\" title=\"Animal husbandry/pt-br\">Criação de animais</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Animal_husbandry/pt-br\" title=\"Animal husbandry/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Cooking/pt-br\" title=\"Cooking/pt-br\">Cozimento</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cooking/pt-br\" title=\"Cooking/pt-br\"> </a></span></td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Comestíveis</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #CCBCAB;\"><a href=\"/Fruit/pt-br\" title=\"Fruit/pt-br\">Fruta</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Fruit/pt-br\" title=\"Fruit/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Vegetable/pt-br\" title=\"Vegetable/pt-br\">Legume</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Vegetable/pt-br\" title=\"Vegetable/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Meat/pt-br\" title=\"Meat/pt-br\">Carne</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Meat/pt-br\" title=\"Meat/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Grain/pt-br\" title=\"Grain/pt-br\">Grão</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Grain/pt-br\" title=\"Grain/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Mushroom/pt-br\" title=\"Mushroom/pt-br\">Cogumelo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Mushroom/pt-br\" title=\"Mushroom/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Honey/pt-br\" title=\"Honey/pt-br\">Mel</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Honey/pt-br\" title=\"Honey/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Cheese/pt-br\" title=\"Cheese/pt-br\">Queijo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cheese/pt-br\" title=\"Cheese/pt-br\"> </a></span></td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b><a href=\"/Meal/pt-br\" title=\"Meal/pt-br\">Refeições</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Meal/pt-br\" title=\"Meal/pt-br\"> </a></span></b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Vegetable_stew/pt-br\" title=\"Vegetable stew/pt-br\">Ensopado de legumes</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Vegetable_stew/pt-br\" title=\"Vegetable stew/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Meat_stew/pt-br\" title=\"Meat stew/pt-br\">Ensopado de carne</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Meat_stew/pt-br\" title=\"Meat stew/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Soup/pt-br\" title=\"Soup/pt-br\">Sopa</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Soup/pt-br\" title=\"Soup/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Porridge/pt-br\" title=\"Porridge/pt-br\">Mingau</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Porridge/pt-br\" title=\"Porridge/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Scrambled_eggs/pt-br\" title=\"Scrambled eggs/pt-br\">Ovos mexidos</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Scrambled_eggs/pt-br\" title=\"Scrambled eggs/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Bread/pt-br\" title=\"Bread/pt-br\">Pão</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bread/pt-br\" title=\"Bread/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Pie/pt-br\" title=\"Pie/pt-br\">Torta</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pie/pt-br\" title=\"Pie/pt-br\"> </a></span></td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b><a href=\"/Food_preservation/pt-br\" title=\"Food preservation/pt-br\">Preservação de alimentos</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Food_preservation/pt-br\" title=\"Food preservation/pt-br\"> </a></span></b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #CCBCAB;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Pickling\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Pickling\">Decapagem</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pickling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Pickling\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cured_meat\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cured meat\">Carne curada</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cured_meat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cured meat\"> </a></span> • <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Geleia</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Cheese/pt-br\" title=\"Cheese/pt-br\">Queijo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cheese/pt-br\" title=\"Cheese/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Alcohol_brewing/pt-br\" title=\"Alcohol brewing/pt-br\">Álcool</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Alcohol_brewing/pt-br\" title=\"Alcohol brewing/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cellar\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cellar\">Despensa</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cellar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cellar\"> </a></span></td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Ferramentas de cozinha</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Firepit/pt-br\" title=\"Firepit/pt-br\">Fogueira</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Firepit/pt-br\" title=\"Firepit/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Clay_oven/pt-br\" title=\"Clay oven/pt-br\">Forno de barro</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Clay_oven/pt-br\" title=\"Clay oven/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Cooking_pot/pt-br\" title=\"Cooking pot/pt-br\">Panela</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cooking_pot/pt-br\" title=\"Cooking pot/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Quern/pt-br\" title=\"Quern/pt-br\">Moinho manual</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Quern/pt-br\" title=\"Quern/pt-br\"> </a></span></td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Utensílios</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #CCBCAB;\"><a href=\"/Bowl/pt-br\" title=\"Bowl/pt-br\">Tigela</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bowl/pt-br\" title=\"Bowl/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Crock/pt-br\" title=\"Crock/pt-br\">Pote de cerâmica</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Crock/pt-br\" title=\"Crock/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Storage_vessel/pt-br\" title=\"Storage vessel/pt-br\">Recipiente de armazenamento</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Storage_vessel/pt-br\" title=\"Storage vessel/pt-br\"> </a></span></td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: 